===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|ru|дворъ||ru-PRO}}

===Etymology===
{{root|ru|ine-pro|*dʰwer-}}
{{inh+|ru|orv|дворъ}}, from {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*dvòrъ}}.

Cognates include {{cog|la|forum}} and {{cog|sa|द्वार}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-двор.ogg}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun+|b|adj=дворо́вый|dim=дво́рик}}

# [[yard]]
#* {{quote-book|ru|year=1887|author=w:ru:Антон Чехов<t:{{w|Anton Chekhov}}>|title=s:ru:[[Нищий (Чехов)|Нищий]]|chapter=|location=|publisher=|newversion=English translation from|translator2=w:en:Constance Garnett|title2=s:en:[[The Beggar (Chekhov)|The Beggar]]|location2=|publisher2=|year2=|page2=|pageurl2=
|text=Скворцо́в поспеши́л в столо́вую. Там из о́кон, выходи́вших на '''двор''', ви́ден был дровяно́й сара́й и всё, что происходи́ло на '''дворе́'''.|t=Skvortsov hurried into the dining-room. There from the window which looked out into the '''yard''' he could see the woodshed and everything that happened in the '''yard'''.}}
# [[courtyard]]
# [[homestead]]
# [[court]]
# {{lb|ru|historical}} [[royal family]] and its closest associates

